    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is \u201cUNION SURVIVORS\u201d?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3178030/extras/72a3debfb50a29c12be3c7b317151e42.poster.avif?t=1753416973\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3178030/extras/72a3debfb50a29c12be3c7b317151e42.webm?t=1753416973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3178030/extras/72a3debfb50a29c12be3c7b317151e42.mp4?t=1753416973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;UNION SURVIVORS&quot; is a roguelite mining survival game that supports online cooperative play for up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players dig through slime-filled terrain to carve their paths and defeat hordes of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Possibilities for Character Development Are Endless</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3178030/extras/7b6e02783c132c0d8b01552ebc609e6e.poster.avif?t=1753416973\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3178030/extras/7b6e02783c132c0d8b01552ebc609e6e.webm?t=1753416973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3178030/extras/7b6e02783c132c0d8b01552ebc609e6e.mp4?t=1753416973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players defeat enemies and choose from a variety of level-up options to enhance their characters' abilities. <br>As characters level up, new weapons are unlocked, further strengthening their combat power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon and level-up choice influences the build, making every challenge a unique experience and ensuring no two playthroughs are alike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mine Resources And Race Across The Field!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3178030/extras/3c45a9578d77f70f4d45ad33cf134ef4.poster.avif?t=1753416973\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3178030/extras/3c45a9578d77f70f4d45ad33cf134ef4.webm?t=1753416973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3178030/extras/3c45a9578d77f70f4d45ad33cf134ef4.mp4?t=1753416973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slimes blocking the path may contain essential resources needed to strengthen characters or provide healing items.<br>Instead of always taking the safest route, players are encouraged to forge their own paths and face challenges head-on.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is \u201cUNION SURVIVORS\u201d?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3178030/extras/72a3debfb50a29c12be3c7b317151e42.poster.avif?t=1753416973\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3178030/extras/72a3debfb50a29c12be3c7b317151e42.webm?t=1753416973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3178030/extras/72a3debfb50a29c12be3c7b317151e42.mp4?t=1753416973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;UNION SURVIVORS&quot; is a roguelite mining survival game that supports online cooperative play for up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players dig through slime-filled terrain to carve their paths and defeat hordes of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Possibilities for Character Development Are Endless</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3178030/extras/7b6e02783c132c0d8b01552ebc609e6e.poster.avif?t=1753416973\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3178030/extras/7b6e02783c132c0d8b01552ebc609e6e.webm?t=1753416973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3178030/extras/7b6e02783c132c0d8b01552ebc609e6e.mp4?t=1753416973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players defeat enemies and choose from a variety of level-up options to enhance their characters' abilities. <br>As characters level up, new weapons are unlocked, 